<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    The Basrelief mark: a bold letterform whose two counters are cut as strata.

    Every constraint here was measured rather than assumed; the test results are
    in the commit that added this file. The non-obvious ones are the ones that
    would get undone by accident:

    Coordinates are on the 108dp adaptive-icon layer canvas, not a 48dp icon
    grid. The launcher's guaranteed-visible area is a 66dp CIRCLE of radius 33
    about the centre, so this form's extreme corners sit at radius 32.2 and its
    left-hand corners are rounded. A square-cornered B drawn to fill 108 reaches
    radius 41, and a circular launcher mask shears those corners off - visible on
    a device, never in a build log.

    The counters are subpaths of ONE evenOdd path, not separate elements. A
    separate <path> is its own filled shape, so it would paint the counters white
    instead of cutting them. As subpaths they are genuinely transparent and the
    background layer shows through, which matters the moment the background
    colour changes and is what keeps the themed icon honest.

    Two counters, not zero and not four. With no cutouts the form has no
    counters at all and stops reading as a letter at 24px; at four the bands
    merge at that size. Two is the measured floor and the measured ceiling.

    This same geometry is reused verbatim for the monochrome layer, so a themed
    icon is a shape this app designed rather than one the platform desaturated.
-->
<vector xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"
    android:width="108dp"
    android:height="108dp"
    android:viewportWidth="108"
    android:viewportHeight="108">

    <path
        android:fillColor="#FFFFFF"
        android:fillType="evenOdd"
        android:pathData="M40,25 L58,25 C71,25 78,31 78,40 C78,47 74,51 68,53 C76,55 80,60 80,68 C80,79 71,83 58,83 L40,83 C34,83 30,79 30,73 L30,35 C30,29 34,25 40,25 Z M48,36 L66,36 A3,3 0 0 1 69,39 A3,3 0 0 1 66,42 L48,42 A3,3 0 0 1 45,39 A3,3 0 0 1 48,36 Z M48,61 L68,61 A3,3 0 0 1 71,64 A3,3 0 0 1 68,67 L48,67 A3,3 0 0 1 45,64 A3,3 0 0 1 48,61 Z" />
</vector>
